# This Dockerfile-specific allowlist overrides the repository-wide .dockerignore
# only for the containerized staging simulation. Keep secrets, Git metadata and
# external workspaces out of the build context.
**
!*.py
!portable/
!portable/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!.ai-harness/
!.ai-harness/runtime/
!.ai-harness/runtime/**
!scripts/
!scripts/staging/
!scripts/staging/multi_instance_container_worker.py
